{"study_accession":"PRJNA799936","secondary_study_accession":"SRP356444","title":"Global characterization of peripheral B cells in Parkinson’s disease by single-cell RNA and BCR sequencing","description":"Fresh blood samples were collected from 8 PD patients and 6 age-matched healthy controls. Then, peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) were isolated by Percoll density gradient centrifugation. Next, CD19+ B cells were sorted using fluorescence-activated cell sorting (FACS). Single-cell 5’ gene expression libraries and V(D)J enriched libraries were prepared according to the standard protocols provided by the 10x Genomics Chromium Single Cell Immune Profiling Solution. Finally, single-cell 5’ gene expression and V(D)J libraries were sequenced on Illumina Noveseq 6000, providing 150 bp paired-end reads. Overall design: Single cell RNA and BCR sequencing for B cells from 8 PD patients and 6 age-matched healthy controls.","pubmed":"35250991","geo_series":"","n_samples":28,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN25223042","study_accession":"PRJNA799936","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"HC B cells rep6 (BCR-seq)","description":"HC B cells rep6 (BCR-seq)","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM5831601","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":4,"first_public":"2022-02-11","attributes":[["source_name","Peripheral blood B cells"],["age","65"],["sex","male"],["disease","Healthy control"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR17717593","experiment_accession":"SRX13880552","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":13703183,"base_count":4110954900,"first_public":"2022-02-11","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM5831601: HC B cells rep6 (BCR-seq) Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR17717594","experiment_accession":"SRX13880552","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":10102865,"base_count":3030859500,"first_public":